      "text": "1. Optimizing for Recruiters & Hiring Managers (UX/UI)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Optimizing for Recruiters & Hiring Managers (UX/UI)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FBK7y7SFrEJ__W-1HAqDP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1062.7002312450581,
      "y": 790.3990539091388,
      "width": 770.727783203125,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1413311051,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 677189733,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405172086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recruiters and technical managers scan rapidly. You have\nabout 10 seconds to prove the project's worth.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recruiters and technical managers scan rapidly. You have about 10 seconds to prove the project's worth.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tV0enF5-3uBQF3lD6kCHw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1055.728246381777,
      "y": 810.3990539091388,
      "width": 784.6717529296875,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 677213157,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 1776995435,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405172086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Elevate the Impact: Your current flow is Title -> Links ->\nProblem -> Description -> Quick Start -> Stack. The\nmissing link is Results/Impact. Right after the \"Problem\nStatement,\" add a section for \"Business Value\" or\n\"Impact.\" If you built an automation tool that reduced\nEDA time by 40%, or an ML tracking utility that\nstreamlined deployments, put that metric front and\ncenter.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Elevate the Impact: Your current flow is Title -> Links -> Problem -> Description -> Quick Start -> Stack. The missing link is Results/Impact. Right after the \"Problem Statement,\" add a section for \"Business Value\" or \"Impact.\" If you built an automation tool that reduced EDA time by 40%, or an ML tracking utility that streamlined deployments, put that metric front and center.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MMxxd_H6Tpa9WrnoIuZhC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1061.0202996044331,
      "y": 1180.3990539091387,
      "width": 774.087646484375,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 760211691,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 407290821,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405172086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Move the Tech Stack Up: Recruiters are often doing a\nmental checklist for specific skills (e.g., Python, MLOps,\nspecific frameworks). Move the \"Stack and skills utilised\"\nhigher, perhaps as a visually distinct row of pill-shaped\nbadges just below the Links or Subtitle, so they don't\nhave to scroll to the bottom to find it.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Move the Tech Stack Up: Recruiters are often doing a mental checklist for specific skills (e.g., Python, MLOps, specific frameworks). Move the \"Stack and skills utilised\" higher, perhaps as a visually distinct row of pill-shaped badges just below the Links or Subtitle, so they don't have to scroll to the bottom to find it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G6obVjAhha_7EHrvkHu26",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1050.394292524355,
      "y": 1445.3990539091387,
      "width": 795.3396606445312,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2125442885,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 122423051,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405172086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Visuals: For technical projects, a generic\n\"Project image\" isn't always helpful. Use that right-aligned\nimage space on the detail page for something concrete: a\nsystem architecture diagram, a screenshot of a\nrecommendation engine's output grid, or a data\nvisualization dashboard.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Visuals: For technical projects, a generic \"Project image\" isn't always helpful. Use that right-aligned image space on the detail page for something concrete: a system architecture diagram, a screenshot of a recommendation engine's output grid, or a data visualization dashboard.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e3K6kTVING8cCoHS5PboF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1057.674291303652,
      "y": 1727.8990539091387,
      "width": 780.7796630859375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1222218635,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 1755579173,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405172086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Social Proof/Content Links: If you share deep-dives,\nrelease notes, or mentor others about these specific\nprojects on platforms like LinkedIn, add a section or\nbutton like \"Read my technical deep-dive\" to drive traffic\nto your professional footprint.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Social Proof/Content Links: If you share deep-dives, release notes, or mentor others about these specific projects on platforms like LinkedIn, add a section or button like \"Read my technical deep-dive\" to drive traffic to your professional footprint.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "r7CBKyPYGczfUbQv3E-a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080.2002312450581,
      "y": 2027.8990539091387,
      "width": 735.727783203125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
