      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405213624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Optimizing for SEO, AEO, and GEO (The Machines)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Optimizing for SEO, AEO, and GEO (The Machines)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hywjoaaxujyMEZ9oXWhZS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -792.8953624112035,
      "y": 1399.656982048587,
      "width": 766.2476806640625,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1479992389,
      "version": 367,
      "versionNonce": 2105872459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405216443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Search engines and generative AI models (like ChatGPT,\nGemini, or Perplexity) don't \"see\" your page; they parse\nits structure and semantics.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Search engines and generative AI models (like ChatGPT, Gemini, or Perplexity) don't \"see\" your page; they parse its structure and semantics.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9lPtDpvS1rhx4FMDFh-7t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -815.4868150917911,
      "y": 1587.0279141812118,
      "width": 798.1395874023438,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 374091403,
      "version": 550,
      "versionNonce": 1860442443,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783405273857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Descriptive, Keyword-Rich Headings: Avoid generic <h2>\ntags like \"Brief description.\" Search engines and AI models\nuse headings to understand context. Change it to\nsomething specific like \"Building a Cyber Risk\nQuantification Model\" or \"Developing an Automated EDA\nPipeline.\" * Structured Data (Schema Markup): This is\ncrucial for GEO. Inject JSON-LD Schema markup into your\nHTML. Use the SoftwareSourceCode or\nSoftwareApplication schema for your tools, and explicitly\ndefine properties like codeRepository (your GitHub link),\nprogrammingLanguage, and description. This feeds data\ndirectly to AI search overviews in a format they\nunderstand perfectly.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Descriptive, Keyword-Rich Headings: Avoid generic <h2> tags like \"Brief description.\" Search engines and AI models use headings to understand context. Change it to something specific like \"Building a Cyber Risk Quantification Model\" or \"Developing an Automated EDA Pipeline.\" * Structured Data (Schema Markup): This is crucial for GEO. Inject JSON-LD Schema markup into your HTML. Use the SoftwareSourceCode or SoftwareApplication schema for your tools, and explicitly define properties like codeRepository (your GitHub link), programmingLanguage, and description. This feeds data directly to AI search overviews in a format they understand perfectly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iQJN8Uj5kN4Pmz68oGGyC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 69.43290411788553,
      "y": 1792.8325934902698,
      "width": 750.9597778320312,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
