      "updated": 1783405394744,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Methodology / Data Section: For data-heavy work,\nconsider adding a brief section detailing the data\nsources, algorithms, or evaluation metrics used. This\nproves you understand the science behind the code, not\njust the implementation.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Methodology / Data Section: For data-heavy work, consider adding a brief section detailing the data sources, algorithms, or evaluation metrics used. This proves you understand the science behind the code, not just the implementation.",
